    "text": "Dodge City\nEagle Media to serve as official radio home of Kansas Shrine Bowl\n12 hours ago\nDODGE CITY, Kan. — Eagle Media will serve as the official radio broadcast partner of the 52nd Kansas Shrine Bowl, set for Saturday, June 21, with kickoff scheduled for 7 p.m. at Memorial Stadium in Dodge City. The broadcast team features Gerard Wellbrock as play-by-play, Dustin Armbruster as analyst,...",
